  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1202.79 Unpolluted water",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1202.79 “Unpolluted water” means water that would not cause a violation of receiving water quality standards and would not be benefited by discharge to a sewerage collection system or POTW.\n\nSource. #9798-A, eff 10-9-10 (from Env-Wq 1202.78); ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
